{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"agent_message","text":"I found concrete blockers in the proposed ready carrier: install and link completions do enter the queue, and the existing cursor census skips the `:cursor-cells` rows that v2 proposes reusing for updates. The fuel wrapper also restarts the budget after FFI bridge handling. These affect 6d-a directly.\n"}}
