s after canonical numbering (step 6)\n   and before pending validation (step 8).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md:934:  refusal is not a counterexample), and with no execution between lower\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:762:**Quiescence.** The migration unit is one task: the whole blocked machine\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1904:1. **Quiesce**: the ready-queue must be empty (§7.6.3).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1922:export record — no engine change, no callback, no timer; the drivers of the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2851:| No layer collapsing | Canonicalize, encode, discover, arbitrate, load, restore, execute are separate functions with data between them. The engine's hot loop is untouched: lifting is a pure function over the blocked machine's value, and the exporting state is that value with an emptied wait-set and a retained record — driver discipline, not engine machinery. |\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2972:with one renewal and one program cycle per tick. These entries change no\n    90\t                  :var (do (diagnostic! {:kind :var :source pc})\n    91\t                           (emit! (if (= op :load-bound) [:load-bound x y] [:load-free x])))\n    92\t                  :call (do (doseq [child children] (walk child) (emit! [:push]))\n    93\t                            (emit! [:call (count y) z]))\n    94\t                  :ffi-call (do (doseq [child children] (walk child) (emit! [:push]))\n    95\t                                (emit! [:ffi-call x (count y)]))\n    96\t                  :stream-put (do (walk (nth children 0)) (emit! [:push])\n    97\t                                  (walk (nth children 1)) (emit! [:stream-put]))\n    98\t                  (:define :stream-cursor :stream-next :stream-close :resume)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
